  "name": "preview-button-multidomain",
  "description": "Extends strapi-plugin-preview-button (https://www.npmjs.com/package/strapi-plugin-preview-button) for multiple domains and locales: map locale/slug to frontend hosts and replace {host}. Requires peer strapi-plugin-preview-button@^3. By BrainStation-23 / Abu Sayed (sayedbs, sayed021).",
